atyantaṁ sukham aśnute\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1931,\"bb\":1707,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/28/b1707/\",\"shadow_value\":\"yuñjan – engaging in yoga practice; evam – thus; sadā – always; ātmānam – the self; yogī – one who is in touch with the Supreme Self; vigata – freed from; kalmaṣaḥ – all material contamination; sukhena – in transcendental happiness; brahma-saṁsparśam – being in constant touch with the Supreme; atyantam – the highest; sukham – happiness; aśnute – attains.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"yuñjan\",\"translation\":\"engaging in yoga practice\"},{\"word\":\"evam\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"sadā\",\"translation\":\"always\"},{\"word\":\"ātmānam\",\"translation\":\"the self\"},{\"word\":\"yogī\",\"translation\":\"one who is in touch with the Supreme Self\"},{\"word\":\"vigata\",\"translation\":\"freed from\"},{\"word\":\"kalmaṣaḥ\",\"translation\":\"all material contamination\"},{\"word\":\"sukhena\",\"translation\":\"in transcendental happiness\"},{\"word\":\"brahma-saṁsparśam\",\"translation\":\"being in constant touch with the Supreme\"},{\"word\":\"atyantam\",\"translation\":\"the highest\"},{\"word\":\"sukham\",\"translation\":\"happiness\"},{\"word\":\"aśnute\",\"translation\":\"attains\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1932,\"bb\":1708,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/28/b1708/\",\"body_value\":\"Thus the self-controlled yogī, constantly engaged in yoga practice, becomes free from all material contamination and achieves the highest stage of perfect happiness in transcendental loving service to the Lord.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1933,\"bb\":1709,\"url_path\":\"/en